{"code":"ru","name":"Russian","native":"Русский","phase":1,"medium":"en","file_level":"B2","level":{"title":"Advanced: cases mastery, nuance, culture","goals":["Master genitive and instrumental cases","Use position verbs and debate connectors","Discuss Russian culture with real fluency"],"units":[{"id":"B2-U1","title":"Cases mastery","lessons":[{"id":"B2-U1-L1","title":"Genitive: нет времени","learn":"Missing things take GENITIVE! У МЕНЯ НЕТ ВРЕМЕНИ (I have no time), НЕТ ДЕНЕГ (no money). Genitive endings: -А/-Я (m), -Ы/-И (f). МНОГО + genitive: МНОГО ВОПРОСОВ!","vocab":[{"t":"время","r":"VRYEH-myah","en":"time","pos":"noun"},{"t":"сила","r":"SEE-lah","en":"strength","pos":"noun"},{"t":"возможность","r":"vahz-MOHZH-nahsty","en":"opportunity","pos":"noun"},{"t":"проблема","r":"prah-BLYEH-mah","en":"problem","pos":"noun"},{"t":"вопрос","r":"vah-PROHS","en":"question","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ответ","r":"aht-VYEHT","en":"answer","pos":"noun"},{"t":"дело","r":"DYEH-lah","en":"matter / business","pos":"noun"},{"t":"деньги","r":"DYEHNY-gee","en":"money","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"Нет + genitive","explain":"НЕТ ВРЕМЕНИ (no time), НЕТ ДЕНЕГ (no money), НЕТ ПРОБЛЕМ (no problem!). Genitive singular: ДОМ→ДОМА, МАМА→МАМЫ, ОКНО→ОКНА.","pattern":"нет/много + genitive","examples":[{"t":"У меня нет времени.","r":"oo mih-NYAH nyeht VRYEH-myih-nee.","en":"I have no time."},{"t":"Нет проблем!","r":"nyeht prah-BLYEHM!","en":"No problem!"},{"t":"Много вопросов.","r":"MNOH-gah vah-PROH-sahf.","en":"Many questions."}],"mistakes":["Saying НЕТ ВРЕМЯ — нет needs ВРЕМЕНИ!","Saying МНОГО ВОПРОСЫ — много needs ВОПРОСОВ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Иван","t":"У тебя есть время?","r":"oo tih-BYA yehsty VRYEH-myah?","en":"Do you have time?"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Нет, у меня нет времени!","r":"nyeht, oo mih-NYAH nyeht VRYEH-myih-nee!","en":"No, I have no time!"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Нет проблем! А завтра?","r":"nyeht prah-BLYEHM! ah ZAHF-trah?","en":"No problem! And tomorrow?"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Завтра много дел.","r":"ZAHF-trah MNOH-gah dyehl.","en":"Tomorrow (I have) many things to do."}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I have no time","answer":"У меня нет времени"},{"type":"fill","q":"Нет ___! (problems)","answer":"проблем"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Many questions' is…","options":["Много вопросы","Много вопросов","Многие вопросы","Много вопрос"],"answer":"Много вопросов"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: времени / меня / нет / у","answer":"у меня нет времени"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Нет проблем!","answer":"Нет проблем!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"НЕТ ВРЕМЕНИ uses ВРЕМЕНИ because…","options":["plural","genitive after нет","formal","past tense"],"answer":1,"why":"Нет + genitive."},{"q":"НЕТ ПРОБЛЕМ means…","options":["many problems","no problem","big problem","new problem"],"answer":1,"why":"Нет + проблем (gen pl)."},{"q":"ДОМ → genitive is…","options":["дому","дома","домом","доме"],"answer":1,"why":"Masculine genitive -А."},{"q":"МНОГО + questions is…","options":["много вопросы","много вопросов","многие вопросы","много вопрос"],"answer":1,"why":"Много + genitive plural."},{"q":"ВРЕМЯ means…","options":["money","time","question","matter"],"answer":1,"why":"Время = time."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Genitive worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["time","question","answer"],"key":["время","вопрос","ответ"]},{"instruction":"Нет + genitive.","items":["I have no time","No problem!","Many questions"],"key":["У меня нет времени","Нет проблем!","Много вопросов"]},{"instruction":"Busy talk.","items":["Do you have time?","Tomorrow many things to do"],"key":["У тебя есть время?","Завтра много дел"]}]}},{"id":"B2-U1-L2","title":"Instrumental: с другом","learn":"Company takes INSTRUMENTAL! С ДРУГОМ = with a friend, С ПОДРУГОЙ = with a (girl)friend. Endings: -ОМ/-ЕМ (m/n), -ОЙ/-ЕЙ (f). Professions: Я ВРАЧ (I am a doctor) — bare, no case!","vocab":[{"t":"друг","r":"drook","en":"friend (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"подруга","r":"pah-DROO-gah","en":"friend (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"гордость","r":"GOHR-dahsty","en":"pride","pos":"noun"},{"t":"интерес","r":"een-tyih-RYEHS","en":"interest","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ложка","r":"LOHSH-kah","en":"spoon","pos":"noun"},{"t":"нож","r":"nohsh","en":"knife","pos":"noun"},{"t":"вилка","r":"VEEL-kah","en":"fork","pos":"noun"},{"t":"врач","r":"vrahch","en":"doctor","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"С + instrumental (-ом/-ой)","explain":"С ДРУГОМ (with friend-m), С ПОДРУГОЙ (with friend-f), С СЕМЬОЙ (with family). Tools too: ПИШУ РУЧКОЙ = I write with a pen!","pattern":"с + -ом/-ой","examples":[{"t":"Я гуляю с другом.","r":"yah goo-LYAH-yoo s DROO-gahm.","en":"I walk with a friend."},{"t":"Она живёт с семьёй.","r":"ah-NAH zhih-VYOHT s sihm-YOH-ee.","en":"She lives with family."},{"t":"Я пишу ручкой.","r":"yah pee-SHOO ROOCH-kah-ee.","en":"I write with a pen."}],"mistakes":["Saying С ДРУГ — с needs ДРУГОМ!","Saying Я ЕСТЬ ВРАЧ — no ЕСТЬ: Я ВРАЧ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Анна","t":"С кем ты гуляешь?","r":"s kyehm tih goo-LYAH-yehsh?","en":"Who do you walk with?"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Я гуляю с другом.","r":"yah goo-LYAH-yoo s DROO-gahm.","en":"I walk with a friend."},{"sp":"Анна","t":"А я гуляю с подругой!","r":"ah yah goo-LYAH-yoo s pah-DROO-gah-ee!","en":"And I walk with a (girl)friend!"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Весело!","r":"vih-SYEH-lah!","en":"Fun!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I walk with a friend","answer":"Я гуляю с другом"},{"type":"fill","q":"Она живёт с ___. (family)","answer":"семьёй"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I write with a pen' is…","options":["Я пишу ручка","Я пишу ручкой","Я пишу с ручка","Я пишу ручке"],"answer":"Я пишу ручкой"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: другом / гуляю / с / я","answer":"я гуляю с другом"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Я гуляю с другом.","answer":"Я гуляю с другом."}],"quiz":[{"q":"С ДРУГОМ uses ДРУГОМ because…","options":["plural","instrumental after с","formal","past"],"answer":1,"why":"С + instrumental."},{"q":"С ПОДРУГОЙ means…","options":["with a friend (m)","with a friend (f)","with friends","with family"],"answer":1,"why":"Подруг-ОЙ = feminine instrumental."},{"q":"Я ПИШУ РУЧКОЙ means…","options":["I see a pen","I write with a pen","I buy a pen","I want a pen"],"answer":1,"why":"Tools take instrumental."},{"q":"С КЕМ? means…","options":["with whom?","with what?","where?","when?"],"answer":0,"why":"С кем = with whom."},{"q":"ВРАЧ means…","options":["teacher","doctor","friend","cook"],"answer":1,"why":"Врач = doctor."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Instrumental worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["friend (m)","spoon","doctor"],"key":["друг","ложка","врач"]},{"instruction":"С + instrumental.","items":["I walk with a friend","She lives with family","I write with a pen"],"key":["Я гуляю с другом","Она живёт с семьёй","Я пишу ручкой"]},{"instruction":"Company talk.","items":["Who do you walk with?","Fun!"],"key":["С кем ты гуляешь?","Весело!"]}]}}]},{"id":"B2-U2","title":"Nuance","lessons":[{"id":"B2-U2-L1","title":"Position: стоит, лежит, сидит","learn":"WHERE things are needs the right verb! КНИГА ЛЕЖИТ (book lies flat), ЧАШКА СТОИТ (cup stands), КОТ СИДИТ (cat sits). Flat→ЛЕЖАТЬ, tall→СТОЯТЬ, seated→СИДЕТЬ. Placement: СТАВЛЮ (stand it), КЛАДУ (lay it)!","vocab":[{"t":"стоять","r":"stah-YAHTY","en":"to stand / be standing","pos":"verb"},{"t":"лежать","r":"lih-ZHAHTY","en":"to lie / be lying","pos":"verb"},{"t":"сидеть","r":"see-DYEHTY","en":"to sit / be sitting","pos":"verb"},{"t":"висеть","r":"vee-SYEHTY","en":"to hang","pos":"verb"},{"t":"ставить","r":"STAH-veety","en":"to stand (put upright)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"класть","r":"klahsty","en":"to lay (put flat)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"вешать","r":"VYEH-shahty","en":"to hang up","pos":"verb"},{"t":"садиться","r":"sah-DEET-syah","en":"to sit down","pos":"verb"}],"grammar":{"title":"Position vs placement","explain":"СТОИТ = stands (cup, house), ЛЕЖИТ = lies (book, phone), ВИСИТ = hangs (picture). To PLACE: СТАВЛЮ ЧАШКУ (I stand the cup), КЛАДУ КНИГУ (I lay the book). State vs action — different verbs!","pattern":"стоит/лежит/висит (state) · ставлю/кладу (action)","examples":[{"t":"Книга лежит на столе.","r":"KNEE-gah lih-ZHIHT nah stah-LYEH.","en":"The book lies on the table."},{"t":"Чашка стоит на столе.","r":"CHAHSH-kah stah-EET nah stah-LYEH.","en":"The cup stands on the table."},{"t":"Я кладу книгу на стол.","r":"yah klah-DOO KNEE-goo nah stohl.","en":"I lay the book on the table."}],"mistakes":["Saying КНИГА СТОИТ — flat books ЛЕЖАТ!","Saying Я СТАВЛЮ КНИГУ — books go КЛАДУ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Иван","t":"Где мои ключи?","r":"gdyeh mah-EE klyoo-CHEE?","en":"Where are my keys?"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Они лежат на столе.","r":"ah-NEE lih-ZHAHT nah stah-LYEH.","en":"They lie on the table."},{"sp":"Иван","t":"А чашка?","r":"ah CHAHSH-kah?","en":"And the cup?"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Чашка стоит рядом.","r":"CHAHSH-kah stah-EET RYAH-dahm.","en":"The cup stands nearby."}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: The book lies on the table","answer":"Книга лежит на столе"},{"type":"fill","q":"Чашка ___ на столе. (stands)","answer":"стоит"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I lay the book on the table' is…","options":["Я ставлю книгу на стол","Я кладу книгу на стол","Я вешаю книгу на стол","Я сажусь книгу на стол"],"answer":"Я кладу книгу на стол"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: столе / лежит / на / книга","answer":"книга лежит на столе"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Книга лежит на столе.","answer":"Книга лежит на столе."}],"quiz":[{"q":"КНИГА ЛЕЖИТ because books are…","options":["tall","flat","round","heavy"],"answer":1,"why":"Flat things lie (лежать)."},{"q":"ЧАШКА СТОИТ because cups…","options":["lie flat","stand upright","hang","sit"],"answer":1,"why":"Upright things stand (стоять)."},{"q":"Я КЛАДУ КНИГУ means…","options":["I see the book","I lay the book","I read the book","I want the book"],"answer":1,"why":"Класть = lay flat."},{"q":"Pictures on walls…","options":["стоят","лежат","висят","сидят"],"answer":2,"why":"Висеть = hang."},{"q":"САДИТЬСЯ means…","options":["to stand up","to sit down","to lie down","to hang up"],"answer":1,"why":"Садиться = sit down."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Position verbs worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["to stand","to lie","to hang"],"key":["стоять","лежать","висеть"]},{"instruction":"State or action?","items":["The book lies on the table","The cup stands on the table","I lay the book on the table"],"key":["Книга лежит на столе","Чашка стоит на столе","Я кладу книгу на стол"]},{"instruction":"Find things.","items":["Where are my keys?","They lie on the table"],"key":["Где мои ключи?","Они лежат на столе"]}]}},{"id":"B2-U2-L2","title":"Debate: хотя, поэтому, однако","learn":"Debate like a Russian! ХОТЯ (although), ПОЭТОМУ (that's why), ОДНАКО (however), КАЖЕТСЯ (it seems), КОНЕЧНО (of course). Chain them: ХОТЯ ДОРОГО, ОДНАКО ЛУЧШЕ!","vocab":[{"t":"хотя","r":"khah-TYAH","en":"although","pos":"conjunction"},{"t":"поэтому","r":"pah-eh-TOH-moo","en":"that's why","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"однако","r":"ahd-NAH-kah","en":"however","pos":"conjunction"},{"t":"значит","r":"ZNAH-cheet","en":"so / it means","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"конечно","r":"kah-NYEHSH-nah","en":"of course","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"возможно","r":"vahz-MOHZH-nah","en":"possibly","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"кажется","r":"KAH-zhih-tsyah","en":"it seems","pos":"verb"},{"t":"соглашаться","r":"sahg-lah-SHAHT-syah","en":"to agree","pos":"verb"}],"grammar":{"title":"Debate connectors","explain":"ХОТЯ ХОЛОДНО, ПОЙДЁМ ГУЛЯТЬ = Although it's cold, let's walk. ПОЭТОМУ gives reasons, ОДНАКО concedes. КАЖЕТСЯ softens: КАЖЕТСЯ, ДОЖДЬ = Seems like rain.","pattern":"хотя… однако… поэтому…","examples":[{"t":"Хотя дорого, однако лучше.","r":"khah-TYAH DOH-rah-gah, ahd-NAH-kah LOOCH-shih.","en":"Although expensive, however better."},{"t":"Холодно, поэтому я дома.","r":"khah-LOHD-nah, pah-eh-TOH-moo yah DOH-mah.","en":"It's cold, that's why I'm home."},{"t":"Кажется, будет дождь.","r":"KAH-zhih-tsyah, BOO-dih-tyehp-LOH.","en":"It seems it will rain."}],"mistakes":["Starting every sentence with НО — vary with ОДНАКО!","Saying ПОТОМУ alone — result needs ПОЭТОМУ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Анна","t":"Метро лучше, хотя там шумно.","r":"miht-ROH LOOCH-shih, khah-TYAH tahm SHOOM-nah.","en":"The metro is better, although it's noisy."},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Однако машина быстрее!","r":"ahd-NAH-kah mah-SHIH-nah bihst-RYEH-yeh!","en":"However the car is faster!"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Возможно. Но метро дешевле, поэтому я за метро.","r":"vahz-MOHZH-nah. noh miht-ROH dih-SHEHV-lyeh, pah-eh-TOH-moo yah zah miht-ROH.","en":"Possibly. But the metro is cheaper, so I'm for the metro."},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Конечно, ты права!","r":"kah-NYEHSH-nah, tih prah-VAH!","en":"Of course, you're right!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Although expensive, however better","answer":"Хотя дорого, однако лучше"},{"type":"fill","q":"___, будет дождь. (It seems)","answer":"Кажется"},{"type":"choose","q":"'That's why I'm home' is…","options":["Потому я дома","Поэтому я дома","Однако я дома","Хотя я дома"],"answer":"Поэтому я дома"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: лучше / дорого / однако / хотя","answer":"хотя дорого однако лучше"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Хотя дорого, однако лучше.","answer":"Хотя дорого, однако лучше."}],"quiz":[{"q":"ХОТЯ means…","options":["because","although","that's why","of course"],"answer":1,"why":"Хотя = although."},{"q":"ПОЭТОМУ means…","options":["however","although","that's why","possibly"],"answer":2,"why":"Поэтому = that's why."},{"q":"ОДНАКО means…","options":["however","because","although","of course"],"answer":0,"why":"Однако = however."},{"q":"КАЖЕТСЯ means…","options":["of course","it seems","possibly","so"],"answer":1,"why":"Кажется = it seems."},{"q":"КОНЕЧНО means…","options":["possibly","however","of course","although"],"answer":2,"why":"Конечно = of course."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Debate worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["although","that's why","however"],"key":["хотя","поэтому","однако"]},{"instruction":"Argue.","items":["Although expensive, however better","It's cold, that's why I'm home"],"key":["Хотя дорого, однако лучше","Холодно, поэтому я дома"]},{"instruction":"Soften opinions.","items":["Possibly","It seems it will rain"],"key":["Возможно","Кажется, будет дождь"]}]}}]},{"id":"B2-U3","title":"Culture and mastery","lessons":[{"id":"B2-U3-L1","title":"Russian culture and душа","learn":"Culture time! БОРЩ (beet soup), БЛИНЫ (pancakes), ПЕЛЬМЕНИ (dumplings), БАНЯ (sauna). And ДУША (soul) — Russians do everything С ДУШОЙ (with soul): ПОГОВОРИМ ПО ДУШАМ = let's have a heart-to-heart!","vocab":[{"t":"борщ","r":"bohrshty","en":"beet soup","pos":"noun"},{"t":"блины","r":"blee-NIH","en":"pancakes","pos":"noun"},{"t":"пельмени","r":"pihl-MYEH-nee","en":"dumplings","pos":"noun"},{"t":"баня","r":"BAH-nyah","en":"sauna / bathhouse","pos":"noun"},{"t":"самовар","r":"sah-mah-VAHR","en":"samovar (tea urn)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"матрёшка","r":"mah-TRYOHSH-kah","en":"nesting doll","pos":"noun"},{"t":"балалайка","r":"bah-lah-LAH-ee-kah","en":"balalaika","pos":"noun"},{"t":"душа","r":"doo-SHAH","en":"soul","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"С душой: with soul","explain":"С ДУШОЙ = with soul (wholeheartedly). ПО ДУШАМ = heart-to-heart. ДУША КОМПАНИИ = life of the party. Learn ДУША phrases — they unlock Russian hearts!","pattern":"с душой · по душам","examples":[{"t":"Он поёт с душой.","r":"ohn pah-YOHT s doo-SHOY.","en":"He sings with soul."},{"t":"Поговорим по душам!","r":"pah-gah-vah-REEM pah doo-SHAHM!","en":"Let's have a heart-to-heart!"},{"t":"Она душа компании.","r":"ah-NAH doo-SHAH kahm-PAH-nee-ee.","en":"She is the life of the party."}],"mistakes":["Translating word-by-word: ПО ДУШАМ = heart-to-heart, not 'by souls'!","Saying С ДУША — с needs ДУШОЙ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Иван","t":"Ты пробовал борщ?","r":"tih PROH-bah-vah-l bohrshty?","en":"Have you tried borscht?"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Да! Бабушка готовит с душой.","r":"dah! BAH-boosh-kah gah-TOH-veet s doo-SHOY.","en":"Yes! Grandma cooks with soul."},{"sp":"Иван","t":"А блины?","r":"ah blee-NIH?","en":"And pancakes?"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Обожаю! Поговорим по душам за чаем!","r":"ah-bah-ZHAH-yoo! pah-gah-vah-REEM pah doo-SHAHM zah CHAH-yahm!","en":"I adore them! Heart-to-heart over tea!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: He sings with soul","answer":"Он поёт с душой"},{"type":"fill","q":"Поговорим ___! (heart-to-heart)","answer":"по душам"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Life of the party' is…","options":["душа компании","с душой","по душам","душа нараспашку"],"answer":"душа компании"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: душой / поёт / с / он","answer":"он поёт с душой"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Поговорим по душам!","answer":"Поговорим по душам!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"С ДУШОЙ means…","options":["with sadness","with soul","with friends","with music"],"answer":1,"why":"С душой = wholeheartedly."},{"q":"ПОГОВОРИМ ПО ДУШАМ means…","options":["let's argue","let's have a heart-to-heart","let's sing","let's eat"],"answer":1,"why":"По душам = heart-to-heart."},{"q":"БОРЩ is…","options":["pancakes","beet soup","dumplings","tea"],"answer":1,"why":"Борщ = beet soup."},{"q":"ПЕЛЬМЕНИ are…","options":["soups","dumplings","pancakes","salads"],"answer":1,"why":"Пельмени = dumplings."},{"q":"БАНЯ is…","options":["a soup","a sauna","a doll","a dance"],"answer":1,"why":"Баня = bathhouse/sauna."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Culture worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["beet soup","soul","sauna"],"key":["борщ","душа","баня"]},{"instruction":"Soul phrases.","items":["He sings with soul","Let's have a heart-to-heart","She is the life of the party"],"key":["Он поёт с душой","Поговорим по душам","Она душа компании"]},{"instruction":"Food talk.","items":["Have you tried borscht?","Grandma cooks with soul"],"key":["Ты пробовал борщ?","Бабушка готовит с душой"]}]}},{"id":"B2-U3-L2","title":"Fluency review: storytelling","learn":"Graduation! Weave tales: СНАЧАЛА (at first), ЗАТЕМ (then), ВДРУГ (suddenly), НАКОНЕЦ (at last), В КОНЦЕ КОНЦОВ (in the end). Mix pasts, aspects, cases. Tell YOUR Moscow story!","vocab":[{"t":"сначала","r":"snah-CHAH-lah","en":"at first","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"затем","r":"zah-TYEHM","en":"then","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"вдруг","r":"vdrook","en":"suddenly","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"наконец","r":"nah-kah-NYEHTS","en":"at last","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"в конце концов","r":"f kahn-TSEH kahn-TSOHF","en":"in the end","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"кстати","r":"KSTAH-tee","en":"by the way","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"наоборот","r":"nah-ah-bah-ROHT","en":"on the contrary","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"жаль","r":"zhahly","en":"pity / sorry","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"Story spine: сначала… наконец","explain":"СНАЧАЛА… ЗАТЕМ… ВДРУГ… НАКОНЕЦ… — the four-beat Russian story spine. Add cases and aspects: ПРИШЁЛ В МОСКВУ, ЖИЛ ТАМ, ПРОЧИТАЛ ВСЁ!","pattern":"сначала → затем → вдруг → наконец","examples":[{"t":"Сначала я пришёл в Москву.","r":"snah-CHAH-lah yah pree-SHOHL v mahsk-VOO.","en":"At first I came to Moscow."},{"t":"Вдруг пошёл снег!","r":"vdrook pah-SHOHL snyehk!","en":"Suddenly snow fell!"},{"t":"Наконец, я дома.","r":"nah-kah-NYEHTS, yah DOH-mah.","en":"At last, I'm home."}],"mistakes":["Listing events without spine words — always СНАЧАЛА…ЗАТЕМ!","Staying in one tense — mix ПРИШЁЛ + ЖИЛ + ПРОЧИТАЛ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Анна","t":"Расскажи свою историю!","r":"rahs-kah-ZHIH svah-YOO ees-TOH-ree-yoo!","en":"Tell your story!"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Сначала я пришёл в Москву. Было холодно.","r":"snah-CHAH-lah yah pree-SHOHL v mahsk-VOO. BIH-lah khah-LOHD-nah.","en":"At first I came to Moscow. It was cold."},{"sp":"Анна","t":"А затем?","r":"ah zah-TYEHM?","en":"And then?"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Вдруг пошёл снег! Наконец, я дома!","r":"vdrook pah-SHOHL snyehk! nah-kah-NYEHTS, yah DOH-mah!","en":"Suddenly snow fell! At last, I'm home!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: At first I came to Moscow","answer":"Сначала я пришёл в Москву"},{"type":"fill","q":"___, я дома. (At last)","answer":"Наконец"},{"type":"choose","q":"The story spine is…","options":["затем, сначала, вдруг","сначала, затем, вдруг, наконец","наконец, вдруг, затем","вдруг, наконец, сначала"],"answer":"сначала, затем, вдруг, наконец"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: снег / пошёл / вдруг","answer":"вдруг пошёл снег"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Сначала я пришёл в Москву.","answer":"Сначала я пришёл в Москву."}],"quiz":[{"q":"The story spine is…","options":["но, потому, что","сначала, затем, вдруг, наконец","да, нет, может","я, ты, он"],"answer":1,"why":"Сначала→затем→вдруг→наконец."},{"q":"ВДРУГ means…","options":["slowly","suddenly","finally","then"],"answer":1,"why":"Вдруг = suddenly."},{"q":"НАКОНЕЦ means…","options":["at first","at last","suddenly","by the way"],"answer":1,"why":"Наконец = at last."},{"q":"ЖАЛЬ means…","options":["joy","pity / sorry","anger","fear"],"answer":1,"why":"Жаль = pity (как жаль!)."},{"q":"КСТАТИ means…","options":["finally","by the way","suddenly","however"],"answer":1,"why":"Кстати = by the way."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Storytelling worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["at first","suddenly","at last"],"key":["сначала","вдруг","наконец"]},{"instruction":"Spine a story.","items":["At first I came to Moscow","Suddenly snow fell","At last, I'm home"],"key":["Сначала я пришёл в Москву","Вдруг пошёл снег","Наконец, я дома"]},{"instruction":"Tell it.","items":["Tell your story!","It was cold"],"key":["Расскажи свою историю!","Было холодно"]}]}}]}],"test":{"title":"B2 final test","items":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I have no time","answer":"У меня нет времени"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I walk with a friend","answer":"Я гуляю с другом"},{"type":"choose","q":"'The book lies on the table'","options":["Книга стоит на столе","Книга лежит на столе","Книга висит на столе","Книга сидит на столе"],"answer":"Книга лежит на столе"},{"type":"translate_t","q":"Хотя дорого, однако лучше.","answer":"Although expensive, however better."},{"type":"fill","q":"Нет ___! (problems)","answer":"проблем"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Let's have a heart-to-heart'","options":["Поговорим с душой","Поговорим по душам","Поговорим о душе","Поговорим за душу"],"answer":"Поговорим по душам"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: снег / пошёл / вдруг","answer":"вдруг пошёл снег"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Поговорим по душам!","answer":"Поговорим по душам!"},{"type":"fill","q":"___, я дома. (At last)","answer":"Наконец"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: He sings with soul","answer":"Он поёт с душой"}]}}}